# Vocal swap - trade the middles, so two voices never talk over each other.
#
# The bass and the top are crossed over slowly and the midrange - where a voice lives - is
# handed across quickly and late. On tracks with singing this is the difference between a
# mix and a mess.

name    Vocal swap
note    hands the midrange across late, so two voices never collide
align   beat
tempo   free
power   constant

lane out gain
    at 0.0    1.0    power-down
    at 1.0    0.0    hold

lane in gain
    at 0.0    0.0    power-up
    at 1.0    1.0    hold

lane out mid
    at 0.0      0    smooth
    at 0.45     0    smooth
    at 0.6    -24    hold
    at 1.0    -24    hold

lane in mid
    at 0.0    -24    smooth
    at 0.45   -24    smooth
    at 0.6      0    hold
    at 1.0      0    hold
